           "id": "2089:30732",
           "name": "Verification is optional, but without it",
           "type": "TEXT",
           "x": 0,
           "y": 22,
           "width": 308,
           "height": 180,
           "fill": "#000000",
           "characters": "Verification is optional, but without it you can't rent the items or take the bookings that need it. You can remove your verification data any time from your Profile, without deleting your account, and you can delete your Renit account from Profile, Personal details. Copies in our backups are cleared within 30 days after the 180 days. Questions about your data: support@simplyrenit.com.",
